{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch The Darkness</strong> is a first-person psychological horror, where the light switch is the only way out.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you flip the switch, <strong>reality changes</strong>.<br>The inhabitants of the house - and the house itself - live their own life.\u00a0  <br>Objects deform.\u00a0<br>The world pretends to be normal - but only at first glance.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only weapon is your <strong>perception</strong>.\u00a0<br>Your enemy is the <strong>anomalies</strong> that live in the house.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust your eyes.\u00a0<br>Trust your ears.\u00a0<br>Trust the light.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If an anomaly is detected -\u00a0<strong>Switch The Darkness!</strong>\u00a0<br><br><strong>Play Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15-60 minutes</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4157330?t=1762649447","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/f25e9a50ad617145d3d09fae97526fca30a18045/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762649447","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/a00a513e0daf9f0b9ef2e69ef8cb53bbf17da7b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762649447","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/a00a513e0daf9f0b9ef2e69ef8cb53bbf17da7b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762649447","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains psychological horror elements, tense atmosphere, unsettling audio and visual effects, and sudden scares.\r\nThere is no graphic violence, no gore, and no sexual content.\r\nSome players may find certain scenes and themes disturbing due to the eerie and oppressive tone of the game."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch The Darkness</strong> is a first-person psychological horror, where the light switch is the only way out.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you flip the switch, <strong>reality changes</strong>.<br>The inhabitants of the house - and the house itself - live their own life.\u00a0  <br>Objects deform.\u00a0<br>The world pretends to be normal - but only at first glance.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only weapon is your <strong>perception</strong>.\u00a0<br>Your enemy is the <strong>anomalies</strong> that live in the house.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust your eyes.\u00a0<br>Trust your ears.\u00a0<br>Trust the light.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If an anomaly is detected -\u00a0<strong>Switch The Darkness!</strong>\u00a0<br><br><strong>Play Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15-60 minutes</p>","developers":["Anton Neverov"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4157330/76a478d8e682f31924ea081d6feebf68dae4495f/header.jpg?t=1762649447","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4157330/1073024752/a4ca1e943bb8629256cac9858eaf597a5536ed2c/1762367067/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762598097","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4157330/1073024752/a4ca1e943bb8629256cac9858eaf597a5536ed2c/1762367067/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762598097","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4157330/1073024752/a4ca1e943bb8629256cac9858eaf597a5536ed2c/1762367067/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762598097","id":257227278,"name":"Switch the Darkness Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257227278/71ee24fd76cefa8c6ef7f4f52c6ca34f775fd44b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762598097"}],"name":"Switch the Darkness","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum